qualification = "Nonce implementation and all funded assertions retained from the previous attempt; migrate both transcript consumers from retired verify::Level/verification_level to the actual Rung::Receipted/rung interface. No successful qualification is claimed. The current attempt uses hf-build and, if it passes, hf-done for revision-bound evidence; prior unrelated findings remain recorded below."
inputs = "PAY2_COMMITTED_AUTHORITY names an operator-provisioned JSON file with rpc_url, ca_der, decimal chain_id, and ordered validators (public_key hex and voting_power integer); the integration case also requires PAY2_RPC_URL, PAY2_RPC_CA_DER, PAY2_FUNDED_DID, a fresh PAY2_REPAIR_STORE path and the real runtime clock supervisor."
